  "summary": "Needlework refers to decorative sewing and other textile handicrafts that involve the use of a needle.",
  "description": "Needlework refers to decorative sewing and other textile handicrafts that involve the use of a needle. Needlework may also include related textile crafts like crochet (which uses a hook), or tatting (which uses a shuttle).\n\nSimilar abilities often transfer well between different varieties of needlework, such as fine motor skill and knowledge of textile fibers. Some of the same tools may be used in several different varieties of needlework.",
